  "bodyHash": "99750f69b78b60b4",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/867/18/ima1244564353ge.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>歡迎來到 RealmRPG，這是一個以類似原版的中世紀奇幻內容為特色的模組系列！</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Sea Dwellers</strong> 模組新增了奇特的魚形商人與水下村莊，同時不會偏離原版遊戲的風格與平衡性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/857/newcanvas332342321312-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"597\" height=\"423\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><strong>功能特色</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>12 種海洋商人</strong>，提供獨特商品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>60 餘種建築結構</strong>，豐富空曠的海洋。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>30 餘項新物品</strong>，提升您的水下探索體驗。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>約 10 個任務</strong>來自<strong>海洋龍</strong>，若無詳細探索將難以完成。</span></li>\n<li>全新水下文化——<strong>貽貝（青口）</strong></li>\n<li>5 種全新食物類型</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1271/7/ocean_dragon3-gif.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"633\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/957/11111111111-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>警告</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\">3.0.0 以上版本（包含 Minecraft 1.18 及更高版本）需要安裝 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\">使用光影模組時動畫無法正常顯示？請在光影設定中關閉「實體陰影」。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/956/111111111112-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>設定與建議<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組預設應能與其他已安裝的模組良好共存。雖然沒有傳統的設定檔，您仍可透過自行建立簡單的數據包並加入標籤來自訂多項功能。</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>野生人魚生物（mermorphs）的生成方式透過 placed_feature 進行設定。</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">與 FarmersDelight、Aquaculture、BiomesWeHaveGone、Regions Unexplored、Terralith 有特別相容性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">關於此模組的舊版資訊請見<a href=\"https://github.com/BlackAures1/SeaDwellersWiki/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/955/11111111111222-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用許可與常見問題</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只要註明出處且下載連結指向此頁面，您即可在影片與整合包中使用本模組。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">禁止將本模組的內容（如貼圖、模型等）用於您的專案中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">禁止將本模組重新上傳至其他網站或啟動器。</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前並無開發 Fabric 版本或將新功能移植至舊版本的計畫！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎回報錯誤與提供數值平衡建議。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/958/111111111112222-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"756\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>致謝<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組作者 -<strong> NoCube、Black Aures</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用工具 -<strong> MCreator、Blockbench、Paint.NET</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">靈感來源 -<strong> Luca、《黑湖妖潭》、克蘇魯神話生物。</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;更多 Realm RPG 系列模組：<br><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nocubes-sea-dwellers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/891/22/638332229090166009.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-creep-crop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/895/730/638340578799643798.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-imps-demons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/886/558/638323109380204126.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-dragon-wyrms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/792/638291974755181770.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-fallen-adventurers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/882/139/638313378229849817.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pots-and-mimics-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/847/493/638246901123812282.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></strong></span><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gothic-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/851/851/638254279369665236.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></strong></a></span></p>",
